    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_07",
      "hash64": "3BDDBA0B859F42B6",
      "text": "Illumise, das Glühwürmchen-Pokémon! Ich hab\\ngehört, dass es sich sehr gut mit Volbeat versteht.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_08",
      "hash64": "3BDDC50B859F5567",
      "text": "Das Eichelnuss-Pokémon Samurzel... oder? Einen\\nMoment lang dachte ich, es wär eine echte Nuss![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_09",
      "hash64": "3BDDC40B859F53B4",
      "text": "Webarak, das Fadenwurf-Pokémon! Ob es wohl\\nim Baum ein Netz spinnen will?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_10",
      "hash64": "3BDA370B859C2E46",
      "text": "Raffel, das Raffbacken-Pokémon! Vielleicht sucht\\nes auf den Bäumen nach Nahrung?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
